 "notes": "Fig.3 (e-print file Fig2.pdf) energy-deposition constraint on axion-photon coupling in the SN trapping regime. Traced the thick solid blue \"1 B\" contour (headline: smaller progenitor Rprog=3e12 cm, E_dep=1 bethe=1e51 erg; matches the fiducial R1=3e12 used in Fig.1), extracted as a vector drawing (idx193) in native page coords, calibrated on frame ticks (x: m_a 1-1000 MeV -> eV; y: g_agamma 1e-4..1e-11 GeV^-1). Reported as the full closed excluded-region boundary (perimeter polygon): upper=trapping edge exiting top of frame near m=1 MeV, lower=production edge with flat bottom ~4-5e-10, right tip ~450 MeV. The paper also shows a thin solid \"0.1 B\" contour (large progenitor Rprog=5e13 cm, LESNe; outer, more stringent, tip ~500 MeV, floor ~1.3e-10) and dashed lines = constraints from the incorrect Eq.4 (neglecting production outside PNS), not traced. Not a DM search (dm_density null); paper quotes no statistical CL. Canonical g_agamma with L=-(g/4)aFFdual, no conversion needed.",
